Header completeness: this header uses `std::vector` in the declaration but doesn’t include `<vector>`. Relying on transitive includes is fragile; include `<vector>` here or forward declare with `namespace std { template<class T, class Allocator> class vector; }` (including `<vector>` is preferred).

```suggestion
#include <vector>

jobject vector_VideoCaptureAPIs_to_List(JNIEnv* env, std::vector<cv::VideoCaptureAPIs>& vs);
